          "text": "<p>Knotilus<sup>+</sup> is designed to improve procedural efficiency following insertion of the implant.<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>The knob on the inserter handle is designed to provide tactile clicks to signal disengagement of the implant from the inserter with only four turns.<sup>2,3</sup></p>\n",
